{"id":"MOEX-114020-1301-Q077","title":"一律給分：辨認結構，也要檢查磷酸間的連接","version":"2","batch":"114-1-med1","sourceSha256":"8f039b59ea8c180dd8b9949715c35ceac620563d2cd3cb9211adea73d97ee816","sourceLibraryId":"libfile_d2db2e16e8ec8191a17ac6b48a5dbeeb","sourceAnchor":"q77","shortHtml":"<div><p>官方最終一律給分。A、B、C 可依序辨認 AMP、PLP、FAD 框架；D 接近 NAD⁺，但磷酸橋畫成 P–O–O–P，不能當成正確標準結構。各縮寫的中文名稱與判讀理由見下方。</p></div>","html":"<div><h2>一律給分：辨認結構，也要檢查磷酸間的連接</h2><div><div class=\"reviewed-figure-group\"><figure><figcaption>原選項 A</figcaption><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:788px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.912621359223301\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/38f4cbe80419ea17ec60bcc424eebc209c6200aa27bbf1bf3ff4d436c2a28a07.png\" alt=\"第77題原選項A化學結構\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"788\" height=\"412\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/38f4cbe80419ea17ec60bcc424eebc209c6200aa27bbf1bf3ff4d436c2a28a07.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a></figure><figure><figcaption>原選項 B</figcaption><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:534px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.5798816568047338\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/d4a61d49cbb2885ad3ca087487668661aa3ffccab419edb6f32fd3b3b5743346.png\" alt=\"第77題原選項B化學結構\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"534\" height=\"338\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/d4a61d49cbb2885ad3ca087487668661aa3ffccab419edb6f32fd3b3b5743346.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a></figure><figure><figcaption>原選項 C</figcaption><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:768px;--reviewed-image-ratio:0.6153846153846154\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/ff6031927f126168b28d94db53d173ff56c023f93160c6f5be0f7056186550a7.png\" alt=\"第77題原選項C化學結構\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"768\" height=\"1248\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/ff6031927f126168b28d94db53d173ff56c023f93160c6f5be0f7056186550a7.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a></figure><figure><figcaption>原選項 D</figcaption><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:746px;--reviewed-image-ratio:0.951530612244898\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/53fecaff241ac4789b8ac75e0076e0e515e21ca26ef3e8fcd51bc55e905f2b5a.png\" alt=\"第77題原選項D化學結構\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"746\" height=\"784\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/53fecaff241ac4789b8ac75e0076e0e515e21ca26ef3e8fcd51bc55e905f2b5a.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a></figure></div></div><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\">官方最終答案：一律給分（最終更正）</p><div><p>官方最終答案是第 77 題一律給分。不能把任何單一選項再當唯一官方正答。</p><p>NAD+（氧化型菸鹼醯胺腺嘌呤二核苷酸） 由含腺嘌呤的核苷酸與含菸鹼醯胺的核苷酸，經焦磷酸連結構成；氧化態菸鹼醯胺環帶正電，接受氫化物後成 NADH（還原型菸鹼醯胺腺嘌呤二核苷酸）。</p><p>四張選項圖可依結構比較：A 為 AMP（腺苷單磷酸） 樣，B 為 PLP（磷酸吡哆醛）類框架，C 為 FAD（黃素腺嘌呤二核苷酸）。D 雖有菸鹼醯胺與腺嘌呤雙核苷酸外形，原圖的兩個磷酸間卻畫成 P–O–O–P；標準 NAD⁺ 的焦磷酸橋應為 P–O–P。因此不能把 D 當正確標準結構背下來。這是圖面與標準結構的比對結果；官方更正只註明一律給分，並未在該答案表公布更正理由。</p><h3>選項怎麼分</h3><div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><table><caption>選項解析</caption><thead><tr><th>選項</th><th>解釋</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th><span>選項</span>A</th><td><span>解釋</span>只有腺苷與單磷酸框架，缺菸鹼醯胺核苷酸。</td></tr><tr><th><span>選項</span>B</th><td><span>解釋</span>有含氮單環、醛基與磷酸側鏈，是 PLP（磷酸吡哆醛） 類框架，非 NAD 雙核苷酸。</td></tr><tr><th><span>選項</span>C</th><td><span>解釋</span>含 黃素的三環結構（isoalloxazine）、核糖醇（ribitol） 與 AMP，為 FAD 框架。</td></tr><tr><th><span>選項</span>D</th><td><span>解釋</span>有雙核苷酸外形，但圖中磷酸橋畫成 P–O–O–P，並非標準 NAD⁺ 的 P–O–P；採計仍是一律給分。</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><h3>一起掌握的相關概念</h3><p>NAD 與 niacin（菸鹼酸／菸鹼醯胺，維生素 B3）相關，FAD 與 riboflavin（核黃素，維生素 B2）相關，PLP 是維生素 B6 的輔酶形式。NADP（菸鹼醯胺腺嘌呤二核苷酸磷酸） 在腺苷端核糖的 2′位多一個磷酸，不能僅看「多磷酸」就選 FAD。</p></div><details><summary>結構參考與官方採計</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/CHEBI:15846\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">EMBL-EBI ChEBI：NAD⁺ 標準結構</a>：焦磷酸橋為 P–O–P。</li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=114020&amp;q=1&amp;s=0101&amp;t=M\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部最終更正答案</a>：第77題一律給分。</li></ul></details></div>","imageCount":4,"sourceAnswer":"官方最終答案：一律給分（最終更正）"}